 words that could immediately follow =E2=80=9Cred=E2=80=9D are =E2=80=9Cbed=
=E2=80=9D, =E2=80=9Crad=E2=80=9D, or =E2=80=9Crod=E2=80=9D, since each diff=
ers from =E2=80=9Cred=E2=80=9D by one letter:</p>
