ed,' connected by orange arrows labeled 'dist=3D1'. Stage 3 shows nodes 'ba=
d' and 'rat' (orange) at distance 2 from 'red,' connected by orange arrows =
labeled 'dist=3D2'.  The algorithm progresses layer by layer, exploring nod=
es at increasing distances from the source node 'red'." loading=3D"lazy" wi=
